    {
      "bbox": [
        260,
        1426,
        1895,
        1578
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "This year the City of New York will once again join with other city and state governments, industry and labor in a nation-wide \"Share In America '70\" U. S. Savings Bond campaign.",
