    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        260,
        2053,
        1859,
        2421
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "At this time it is more important than ever to use all possible measures to combat inflation. The stability of our dollar is vital to our economic strength and security. Increased purchases of Savings Bonds by millions of Americans contribute significantly to this objective by resulting in a wide-spread ownership of the public debt, at the same time providing financial security for themselves and their families.",
